{"2192780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grimdark Survivors", "steam_appid": 2192780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE GAME!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1770183731\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.poster.avif?t=1770183731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.webm?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.mp4?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the onslaught of an endless horde of monsters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill monsters, gather their eyes, improve yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelite survival game, all you can do is survive as long as you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources for level up current run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather credits in each run to buy upgrades and help the next survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A lot of Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Builds Every Run. Select from a variety of upgrades to create a unique and overpowered builds every run. You can be a summoner-Drone Operator, for example, and destroy monsters with drones, or ranged sniper who use electrobullets to pierce enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Select Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse selection of characters and weapons that offer a variety of gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.poster.avif?t=1770183731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.webm?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.mp4?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 different upgrades too choose from for a unique experience every run!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide cast of characters and their personalities, with more to come post-launch.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual quick 10-20 minute play sessions, for busy gamers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon, Mechs and Meta System helps you become stronger</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.poster.avif?t=1770183731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.webm?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.mp4?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the onslaught of an endless horde of monsters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill monsters, gather their eyes, improve yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelite survival game, all you can do is survive as long as you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources for level up current run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather credits in each run to buy upgrades and help the next survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A lot of Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Builds Every Run. Select from a variety of upgrades to create a unique and overpowered builds every run. You can be a summoner-Drone Operator, for example, and destroy monsters with drones, or ranged sniper who use electrobullets to pierce enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Select Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse selection of characters and weapons that offer a variety of gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.poster.avif?t=1770183731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.webm?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.mp4?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 different upgrades too choose from for a unique experience every run!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide cast of characters and their personalities, with more to come post-launch.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual quick 10-20 minute play sessions, for busy gamers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon, Mechs and Meta System helps you become stronger</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "To save your world, take out an expanding horde of monsters. To develop one-of-a-kind and game-breaking builds, select from a selection of upgrades. Unlock a wide variety of characters and weapons with special abilities.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/d1f1527e29b10e41bbb67e450dc8e0789fb6461e/header.jpg?t=1770183731", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/e75f7577a5a32306a4b14e37b8a09eb33c1a5298/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770183731", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/e75f7577a5a32306a4b14e37b8a09eb33c1a5298/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770183731", "website": "https://hityara.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core+<br></